   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Painterly classic: median ~114, warm shadows (43,40,34), neutral highlights (212,210,212), orange 25%, sky (114,137,169) sat 0.33, foliage sat 0.40, saturation 0.29. Best for: Composed, calm landscapes: fields, tree lines, lakes, European countryside, soft directional light, heritage buildings in landscape. Gentle and timeless.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
